[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-10
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Implement HDL system tasks, strings, real values and file I/O
STATEMENT: >>>
Self-checking HDL programs execute and fail with exact status/source diagnostics; file malformed/missing/error cases and time-format rounding are tested independently.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-10, P1, relative scope L. Vertical slice implemented and verified under VS-RTL-SYSTASK-001: IEEE 1364 $readmemh/$readmemb loader (loadMemoryHex/loadMemoryBin), formatted display IR/runtime and finish task across C++/C#/Rust backends. General file I/O ($fopen/$fscanf), strings, real values, plusargs and direct UHDM system-task lowering remain open. Dependencies: WP-03, WP-07. Product IDs: VS-RTL-PROC-001, VS-RTL-TYPE-001, VS-RTL-SYSTASK-001. GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/11. Library evaluation: LIB-02, LIB-10.
<<<
