UID: VS-PLAN-WP-14
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Implement assertions, properties and sampled-value semantics
STATEMENT: >>>
Intentionally failing properties demonstrably fail at the expected cycle; no successful build may silently erase verification statements. SVA support remains a declared subset.
<<<
