[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-PLAN-WP-17
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Add HDL tracing, source debugging and model checkpoints
STATEMENT: >>>
Losslessly compressed waveforms satisfying VS-TRACE-COMPRESSED-001 and parsed by an independent reader match known traces; checkpoint restart reproduces future outputs/events exactly and rejects mismatched source/runtime versions.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred planning acceptance for WP-17, P1, relative scope L. Vertical slices implemented and verified under VS-RTL-VCD-001 (IEEE 1364 hierarchical four-state delta-compressed VCD writer) and VS-RTL-CHECKPOINT-001 (versioned binary save/restore checkpoints with schema fingerprint and FNV-1a checksum across W, W64 and W2 models). Compressed FST streaming (VS-TRACE-COMPRESSED-001), timed-frame checkpoint persistence and interactive source debugging remain open. Dependencies: WP-02, WP-06. Product IDs: VS-RTL-VCD-001, VS-RTL-CHECKPOINT-001, VS-TRACE-COMPRESSED-001 (Draft). GitHub issue: https://github.com/jeffadickson/VeloSim/issues/18. Library evaluation: LIB-06, LIB-10, LIB-11, LIB-12.
<<<
